    <title>Acme AI Raises $3M in Seed Funding</title>
    <link>https://news.example.com/2026/10/acme-ai-raises-3m/</link>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <category><![CDATA[Seed]]></category>
    <category><![CDATA[AI]]></category>
    <description><![CDATA[Acme AI raised $3M.]]></description>
    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://www.acme.ai/">Acme AI</a>, a San Francisco-based startup building scheduling agents for clinics, has raised $3M in seed funding.</p><p>The round was led by Foo Ventures. CEO and co-founder Jane Roe said the money will fund the first product hires.</p>]]></content:encoded>
